# Domain Rules

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M1 Technical proofs
Dependencies: `01_PROJECT_FOUNDATION.todo`, accepted territory decisions in `15_PRODUCT_DECISIONS.todo`

## Purpose

Implement deterministic game rules without Unity scene or rendering dependencies.

## Tasks

- [ ] Define element, owner, territory state, player ID, team ID, and match phase value types.
- [ ] Define logical territory cell and field interfaces.
- [ ] Define data-driven reaction rule model.
- [ ] Implement Ice, Fire, and Mist conversions for the slice.
- [ ] Define score and coverage calculation.
- [ ] Define bank award policy.
- [ ] Define match timer and phase transitions.
- [ ] Define explicit tie and zero-ownership behavior.
- [ ] Define seedable randomness abstraction.
- [ ] Validate configuration at construction/bootstrap.
- [ ] Add comprehensive domain unit tests.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Domain assembly has no `UnityEngine` reference.
- [ ] Every in-scope conversion has positive and negative tests.
- [ ] Fixed stamp sequence produces deterministic coverage and bank.
- [ ] Invalid configurations fail with actionable errors.
- [ ] Domain tests run without opening a Unity scene.

